r similar object. the binding is permanent. the subject does not need to breathe, eat, or drink while contained, nor does it age. reduce the save dc by 4.\\n\\nyou can't dispel a binding spell with dispel magic or a similar effect, though an antimagic field or mage's disjunction affects it normally. a bound extraplanar creature cannot be sent back to its home plane by dismissal, banishment, or a similar effect.\"",
